    {
     "title": "Blizzard World",
     "body": "- Some health pack sizes have been reduced\n- Some health pack locations have been changed\n- Additional health packs have been added",
     "dev": "Health packs are a valuable resource in Overwatch and positioning around them is key to holding ground on defense or keeping up momentum on offense. We have moved the location of some health packs and included additional ones to improve game play on Blizzard World."
    }
